# DOMAIN 5 — HOMELAND FEAR LEVER DEPLOYMENT (META-DOMAIN)

## Purpose of this domain
Track when fear is operationalized to justify actions across other domains.

This domain does not stand alone.  
It only activates when fear framing is used to move **policy, enforcement, compliance, or authority**.

This is the narrative → authority conversion layer.

---

## 5.1 What belongs (clarified)

This domain watches:
- framing shifts that precede rule changes  
- emergency language paired with delegation of power  
- normalization of extraordinary measures  
- compression of dissent or review windows  

It does not track sentiment.  
It tracks instrumental fear.

---

## 5.2 What changed (re-baseline)

Fear deployment is now:
- quieter  
- bureaucratic  
- procedural  
- justified as “temporary,” “targeted,” or “technical”  

So we ignore rhetoric and watch coupling.

---

## 5.3 Triggers

### 🔴 ALERT-ELIGIBLE (very strict)

These alert only when fear language directly authorizes action.

| Trigger | P | I | O | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Emergency declarations with enforcement impact | M | H | H | Movement, services |
| Surveillance expansion justified by threat framing | M | H | M | Especially households |
| Suspension of normal process due to “urgency” | L | H | M | Review windows |
| Delegation of authority to automated systems | L | H | L | AI + fear coupling |
| Restriction of access or rights via emergency framing | M | H | M | Quiet but binding |

**Alert rule:**  
👉 Must bind behavior or reduce agency within days, not months.

---

### 🟡 LOG-ONLY (core function)

| Trigger | P | I | O | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Threat inflation without action | H | L | H | Noise |
| Media amplification without policy | H | L | H | Ignore |
| Preparedness rhetoric | M | L | H | Context |
| “Out of an abundance of caution” language | M | M | H | Watch repetition |

Purpose: detect normalization drift over time.

---

### 🔵 SUSPEND / LOW-FOCUS

Deprioritize:
- generalized anxiety narratives  
- speculative threats without authority coupling  
- symbolic alerts without consequence  

---

## 5.4 Household Impact Override (critical)

Immediate escalation only if fear-based actions:
- affect schooling or childcare  
- affect healthcare access  
- affect movement or documentation  
- expand monitoring of households or minors  

Fear without leverage = log.  
Leverage with shortened reaction time = alert.

---

## 5.5 Plateau rule

Domain 5 enters plateau if:
- emergency language does not bind  
- review mechanisms remain intact  
- measures sunset on schedule  

Plateau = monthly review only.
